WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.713 --> 00:00:16.957
women put the mongongo nuts into the pot with water and some roots.

2
00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:21.681
They used a long stick to mash everything together.

3
00:00:23.102 --> 00:00:26.085
As Mandy watched, her stomach began to growl.

4
00:00:26.105 --> 00:00:31.080
"You can do this," said Twi.

5
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.502
She gave Mandy the stick.

6
00:00:33.763 --> 00:00:35.965
Mandy stirred the dark red mixture.

7
00:00:35.985 --> 00:00:42.150
"When the hunters return," said Twi, "we can all enjoy the meal."

8
00:00:43.912 --> 00:00:48.096
Vinnie ran fast until he finally caught up with Kashe and Gau.

9
00:00:49.437 --> 00:00:52.760
They were standing in front of the fallen antelope and smiling.

10
00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.242
"Good fortune!"

11
00:00:55.623 --> 00:00:56.804
Kashe said to Vinnie.

12
00:00:58.208 --> 00:01:02.031
"Usually antelopes can run for a whole day before the poison spreads.

13
00:01:02.492 --> 00:01:03.393
This one was weak."

14
00:01:05.274 --> 00:01:07.836
Other hunters appeared from different directions.

15
00:01:07.856 --> 00:01:10.298
"Did the boy get it?"

16
00:01:11.059 --> 00:01:11.719
asked a man.

17
00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.662
Kashe turned to Vinnie and smiled.

18
00:01:14.682 --> 00:01:18.485
"Perhaps your arrow got this one, Vinnie."

19
00:01:20.386 --> 00:01:21.427
Vinnie shook his head.

20
00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:23.809
"I was too scared to shoot."

21
00:01:25.311 --> 00:01:26.832
He showed them his arrow.

22
00:01:28.076 --> 00:01:29.777
Kashe stuck his chest out.

23
00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:33.820
Vinnie noticed those six scars on his right side.

24
00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:39.904
"In our tribe, you become a man after your first kill," said Kashe.

25
00:01:39.924 --> 00:01:41.825
"Look here."

26
00:01:42.326 --> 00:01:43.967
He pointed to one of his scars.

27
00:01:43.987 --> 00:01:47.309
"I got this when I was your age."

28
00:01:47.329 --> 00:01:50.451
"Did an animal attack you?"

29
00:01:51.092 --> 00:01:51.772
asked Vinnie.

30
00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:54.014
Kashe laughed.

31
00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:57.356
"No, I killed a male antelope.

32
00:01:58.496 --> 00:02:00.697
That's why I have scars on my right side.

33
00:02:02.378 --> 00:02:05.539
If it had been a female, I would have scars on my left side."

34
00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.181
Kashe then pointed to his eyes.

35
00:02:09.201 --> 00:02:12.322
"These scars make me see clearer.

36
00:02:12.762 --> 00:02:14.863
The ones on my arms help me shoot better.

37
00:02:16.223 --> 00:02:19.185
The scars on my chest help me to stay calm when hunting."

38
00:02:20.705 --> 00:02:21.506
"Didn't it hurt?"

39
00:02:22.066 --> 00:02:22.706
asked Vinnie.

40
00:02:24.127 --> 00:02:26.688
He shivered at what might have made those scars.

41
00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.361
Kashe laughed again.

42
00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:31.843
"Pain is part of growing up."

43
00:02:33.405 --> 00:02:35.466
Suddenly Gau shouted loudly.

44
00:02:36.807 --> 00:02:38.269
He pointed toward the trees.

45
00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.572
Two large black rhinos were stamping their feet.

46
00:02:44.194 --> 00:02:46.115
"We must leave," warned Kashe.

47
00:02:46.135 --> 00:02:47.496
"We have disturbed them."

48
00:02:49.358 --> 00:02:52.260
Gau and Kashe began to slowly walk backward.

49
00:02:53.742 --> 00:02:56.123
But the angry animals charged the group.

50
00:02:57.672 --> 00:02:59.974
"I didn't know rhinos ran so fast!"

51
00:03:01.155 --> 00:03:03.217
cried Vinnie as he ran with the men.

52
00:03:04.438 --> 00:03:06.059
Vinnie's heart was racing too.

53
00:03:06.659 --> 00:03:08.161
Suddenly he heard a scream.

54
00:03:08.181 --> 00:03:12.544
"Gau!" shouted Kashe, looking around.

55
00:03:13.805 --> 00:03:15.066
Gau lay on the ground.

56
00:03:16.427 --> 00:03:18.969
A rhino had slashed Gau's leg with his horn.

57
00:03:18.989 --> 00:03:23.073
"We must get him to the village," said Kashe.

58
00:03:23.093 --> 00:03:25.615
"Where are the rhinos?"

59
00:03:26.035 --> 00:03:26.716
Vinnie asked.

60
00:03:28.152 --> 00:03:30.373
"They're gone for now," said Kashe.

61
00:03:30.393 --> 00:03:31.733
"Quick, help me."

62
00:03:33.113 --> 00:03:34.774
They carried Gau to the village.

63
00:03:36.014 --> 00:03:38.495
Kashe explained to everyone what had happened.

64
00:03:39.975 --> 00:03:42.856
Gau was placed near a fire in front of one hut.

65
00:03:43.576 --> 00:03:44.977
He was in a lot of pain.

66
00:03:44.997 --> 00:03:48.438
"Call the healer," ordered Kashe.

67
00:03:49.638 --> 00:03:52.259
Frightened, Mandy ran to Vinnie.

68
00:03:52.279 --> 00:03:54.580
"Did he say healer?"

69
00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:55.740
gulped Vinnie.

70
00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:00.423
Vinnie remembered the healers from their Iroquois travels.
